(text "The DevKit plugs into two 22-pin sockets. Its own 3V3 pins are left open: the board makes +3V3 separately." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 39f2c343-5898-4349-91f0-c81314604640))
(text "GPIO35-37 are used by the octal flash and PSRAM. GPIO47/48 are 1.8 V on the WROOM-2 and stay unused." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5d9107b0-8eec-4107-af7e-9f6c03ecc5f3))
